### ================================================================
### FASE 4 — Edición y Eliminación de Notas (R09)
### Prerequisito: fases 1, 2 y 3 ejecutadas
###
### Estado inicial:
###   subjectId=1, cutId=5 (30%), cutId=6 (30%), cutId=7 (40%)
###   gradeId=1  cutId=5  "Parcial 1"  4.5  60%
###   gradeId=2  cutId=5  "Quiz 1"     3.0  40%
###   Corte 1 average = 3.90
###   overallAverage  = 1.17 (solo Corte 1 calificado)
###
### Secuencia de operaciones y averages resultantes:
###
###   [1] PUT grade 1 → 5.0 (era 4.5)
###       Corte 1 avg = (5.0*60 + 3.0*40)/100 = 4.20
###       overall     = 4.20*30/100 = 1.26
###
###   [2] POST grade en cut2 → gradeId=3, "Examen", 3.5, 100%
###       Corte 2 avg = 3.50
###       overall     = (4.20*30 + 3.50*30)/100 = 2.31
###
###   [3] DELETE grade 2 ("Quiz 1" de cut1)
###       Corte 1 avg = (5.0*60)/60 = 5.00  (solo 60% del corte)
###       overall     = (5.00*30 + 3.50*30)/100 = 2.55
###
### Estado final:
###   gradeId=1  cutId=5  "Parcial 1"  5.0  60%  → Corte 1 avg=5.00
###   gradeId=3  cutId=6  "Examen"     3.5  100% → Corte 2 avg=3.50
###   cutId=7 (Corte 3) sin nota → excluido del overallAverage
###   overallAverage = 2.55
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8002
@ct = application/json
@s1 = 1
@cut1 = 5
@cut2 = 6
@cut3 = 7


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 1 — Error: actualizar nota con gradeValue fuera de rango → 400 Bad Request
# Espera: error de validación
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT grade id=1 con gradeValue=5.5
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades/1
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "activityName": "Parcial 1",
  "gradeValue": 5.5,
  "percentage": 60
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 2 — Error: nota inexistente → 404 Not Found
# Espera: { "success": false, "error": "Nota con id 999 no encontrada", "code": 404 }
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT grade id=999
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades/999
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "activityName": "Fantasma",
  "gradeValue": 4.0,
  "percentage": 60
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 3 — Editar nota: subir "Parcial 1" de 4.5 a 5.0 → 200 OK
# Recalcula Corte 1: (5.0*60 + 3.0*40)/100 = 4.20
# Espera: gradeValue=5.0 en la respuesta
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT grade id=1 — nueva nota 5.0
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades/1
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "activityName": "Parcial 1",
  "gradeValue": 5.0,
  "percentage": 60
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 4 — Verificar promedios tras edición → 200 OK
# Espera:
#   Corte 1 grade=4.20  (5.0*60 + 3.0*40)/100
#   Corte 2 grade=null  (omitido)
#   Corte 3 grade=null  (omitido)
#   overallAverage=1.26  (4.20*30/100)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET averages post-edición
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/averages


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 5 — Registrar nota en Corte 2 → 201 Created
# gradeId=3, cutId=6, "Examen", 3.5, 100%
# Corte 2 avg = 3.50
# overall     = (4.20*30 + 3.50*30)/100 = 2.31
# Espera: grade con id=3
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### POST "Examen" en cut2 — gradeId=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut2}}/grades
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "activityName": "Examen",
  "gradeValue": 3.5,
  "percentage": 100
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 6 — Verificar promedios con 2 cortes calificados → 200 OK
# Espera:
#   Corte 1 grade=4.20
#   Corte 2 grade=3.50
#   Corte 3 grade=null (omitido)
#   overallAverage=2.31
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET averages con 2 cortes calificados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/averages


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 7 — Error: eliminar nota inexistente → 404 Not Found
# Espera: { "success": false, "error": "Nota con id 999 no encontrada", "code": 404 }
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE grade id=999
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades/999


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 8 — Eliminar "Quiz 1" (gradeId=2) del Corte 1 → 204 No Content
# Recalcula Corte 1 con solo gradeId=1: (5.0*60)/60 = 5.00
# overall = (5.00*30 + 3.50*30)/100 = 2.55
# Espera: 204 No Content (sin body)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE grade id=2 — "Quiz 1"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades/2


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 9 — Verificar promedios finales → 200 OK
# Espera:
#   Corte 1 grade=5.00  (solo "Parcial 1" al 60%; avg = 5.0*60/60)
#   Corte 2 grade=3.50
#   Corte 3 grade=null  (omitido)
#   overallAverage=2.55
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET averages estado final
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/averages


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 10 — Listar notas de Corte 1 → 200 OK
# Espera: solo gradeId=1 ("Parcial 1", 5.0, 60%) — el id=2 fue eliminado
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET grades del cut1 post-delete
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 11 — Error: capacidad excedida al editar (suma con otras notas > 100) → 422
# El Corte 1 tiene 60% usado (gradeId=1). Intentar subir ese porcentaje a 110% falla.
# Espera: { "success": false, "error": "No es posible agregar la actividad...", "code": 422 }
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT grade id=1 con percentage=110 (excede capacidad)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects/{{s1}}/cuts/{{cut1}}/grades/1
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "activityName": "Parcial 1",
  "gradeValue": 5.0,
  "percentage": 110
}
